      "summary": {
        "text": "Antares Au (Chinese: 區天駿; Jyutping: Au1 Tin1 Zeon3; born 24 March 1979) is a Hong Kong racing driver and business executive who last competed in the FIA World Endurance Championship for Garage 59. He is the 2024–25 Asian Le Mans Series GT champion and the 2024 Intercontinental GT Challenge Independent Cup champion.",
